WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:03.186
打开 Composer / Open Composer

2
00:00:03.186 --> 00:00:06.086
新建请求 / Create the request

3
00:00:06.086 --> 00:00:08.939
填写演示 URL / Enter the demo URL

4
00:00:08.939 --> 00:00:11.889
选择 POST / Choose POST

5
00:00:11.889 --> 00:00:14.837
填写 JSON Content-Type / Set the JSON Content-Type

6
00:00:14.837 --> 00:00:17.688
打开 Body / Open Body

7
00:00:17.688 --> 00:00:20.788
选择 JSON / Choose JSON

8
00:00:20.788 --> 00:00:23.742
输入 Hello JSON / Enter the JSON body

9
00:00:23.742 --> 00:00:26.587
发送并核对完整 JSON / Send and verify the complete JSON

10
00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:29.535
选择 Text / Choose Text

11
00:00:29.535 --> 00:00:32.387
设置 text/plain / Set text/plain

12
00:00:32.387 --> 00:00:35.186
使用独立文本测试地址 / Use the separate text endpoint

13
00:00:35.186 --> 00:00:38.037
发送并核对文本 / Send and verify text

14
00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:40.936
选择 Form / Choose Form

15
00:00:40.936 --> 00:00:43.838
添加 name=Interceptor / Add name=Interceptor

16
00:00:43.838 --> 00:00:46.788
添加 ready=true / Add ready=true

17
00:00:46.788 --> 00:00:49.636
设置表单 Content-Type / Set the form Content-Type

18
00:00:49.636 --> 00:00:52.437
使用独立表单测试地址 / Use the separate form endpoint

19
00:00:52.437 --> 00:00:55.286
发送并核对表单字节 / Send and verify form bytes

20
00:00:55.286 --> 00:00:58.092
打开 Auth / Open Auth

21
00:00:58.092 --> 00:01:00.944
查看 Bearer 输入位置，不填真实Key / Inspect Bearer input without a real key

22
00:01:00.944 --> 00:01:03.837
查看 Basic 输入位置 / Inspect Basic inputs

23
00:01:03.837 --> 00:01:06.737
恢复 None / Restore None

24
00:01:06.737 --> 00:01:10.036
重命名 Guide form request / Rename the request

25
00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:12.937
新建 Guide collection / Create the collection folder

26
00:01:12.937 --> 00:01:35.507
把请求移入目录 / Move the request into the folder

27
00:01:35.507 --> 00:01:40.377
导出 guide-collection.json / Export the collection

28
00:01:40.377 --> 00:01:54.933
核对实际导出内容 / Verify the exported collection

29
00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:59.982
选择同一个集合文件 / Select the same exported file

30
00:01:59.982 --> 00:02:02.788
检查导入预览 / Review import preview

31
00:02:02.788 --> 00:02:05.742
确认追加而不覆盖 / Confirm append without overwrite
